.DS_Store

# Generated artefacts: printable targets, captured calibration frames, fitted
# intrinsics, tip calibration. All reproducible from the CLI, and the
# intrinsics in particular are specific to one physical camera -- committing
# someone else's would be worse than having none.
#
# Print-ready targets that ARE committed live in assets/, generated once so a
# reader can print and try the project without running anything first.
output/

# Accuracy measurements. These describe one person's camera, print and
# lighting, so they are evidence rather than source: the headline numbers get
# quoted in the README instead. Force-add a specific run with
# `git add -f results/<file>` if you want to publish the raw data.
results/
